{"id":"664963","name":"五味斋茄饼","author":"五味斋主","authorId":"1403610","desc":"","cover":"images/664963/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"1个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"1块"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"食油","amount":"30ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子去皮切丁或切。","img":"images/664963/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐抓碎，打入鸡蛋，加葱花蒜片食盐，撒上面粉拌匀。","img":"images/664963/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"电饼铛倒上食油加热，倒入拌好的食材。","img":"images/664963/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将食材摊开。","img":"images/664963/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"合上电饼铛，上下加热8分钟。","img":"images/664963/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将茄子饼翻面。","img":"images/664963/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再合上加热3分钟。","img":"images/664963/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"即可盛盘食用。","img":"images/664963/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"这次煮了红薯稀饭。","img":"images/664963/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搭配起来很好吃哎。","img":"images/664963/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"茄子也可切丝，先加热5分钟。","img":"images/664963/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻面再加热2分钟。","img":"images/664963/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好啦。","img":"images/664963/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"色香味，还中吧。","img":"images/664963/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"加热时间因食材和炊具酌情而定。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}